{"id":"n62490-1-17","stage":1,"title":"글자 · 字","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62490-1-17-1","ko":"승규야, 이게 무슨 글자니?","zh":"承奎，这是什么字啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"글자니?","meaning":"字，文字","explanation":"글자：字，文字；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"글자","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62490","senseId":"1","lemma":"글자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글자니","audio":"/audio/b67a84a3ada01b418aaa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"068c2631228200cf","term":"글자","zh":"字，文字","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3","entryId":"62490","definition":"记录语言的符号。","pronunciation":["글짜"]}],"audio":"/audio/c66be1b99b61363b9263.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62490-1-17-2","ko":"너무 흘려 써서 저도 무슨 글자인지 도저히 못 알아보