，绝对","explanation":"도저히：怎么也，无论如何，绝对。","readings":[{"term":"도저히","audio":"/audio/f875011623286e4a315b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14397","senseId":"1","lemma":"도저히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도저히","audio":"/audio/f875011623286e4a315b.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"알아보겠어요.","meaning":"辨认，认出","explanation":"알아보다：辨认，认出；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"알아보다","audio":"/audio/1d2b64ddd329540a6838.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16080","senseId":"2","lemma":"알아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아보겠어요","audio":"/audio/65504a31545b483a28f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"潦草，草草","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"不好好写字，随意写。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写（字）","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"写（字）","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"068c2631228200cf","term":"글자","zh":"字，文字","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3","entryId":"62490","definition":"记录语言的符号。","pronunciation":["글짜"]},{"id":"f875011623286e4a","term":"도저히","zh":"怎么也，无论如何，绝对","audio":"/audio/f875011623286e4a315b.mp3","entryId":"14397","definition":"不管怎么做也。","pronunciation":["도ː저히"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"1d2b64ddd329540a","term":"알아보다","zh":"辨认，认出","audio":"/audio/1d2b64ddd329540a6838.mp3","entryId":"16080","definition":"用眼睛看而识别。","pronunciation":["아라보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fb97189de3e1926d70f7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.61,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62490","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1621,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["承奎，这个字是谁教你的？","承奎，你今天写了多少字？","承奎，这是什么字啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["写得太潦草了，我根本看不出这是什么字。","写得很清楚，我一眼就认出来了。","字虽潦草，但我完全能认出来。"],"answer":0}]}
